{
  "name": "Assassinate",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>When using this skill, you may spend up to three [Fate Points] (0 is okay). You gain a +[(Spent [Fate Points] + SR) x 7] bonus to [Weapon Attack] damage rolls.</p>\n<p>(CR11): The multiplier bonus becomes x12.&nbsp;<br>(CR21): The multiplier bonus becomes x20.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A special skill that strikes a precise deadly blow as if sewing the gap between the opponent's mind and body with a needle. The way it quickly reaps lives is worthy of the name of Assassinate.</p>",
